## ---- tbl-06-weights ----
# The three tangency portfolios. The promised Sharpe ratio is computed with
# the estimator's own mean vector; the in-sample Sharpe ratio with the sample
# mean, which is the only one the sample can score. Turnover is the share of
# the portfolio that must be traded to reach each answer from the sample-mean
